@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# 0002 — Reservations fill partially; orders stay all-or-nothing
+
+Status: accepted (2026-10-29)
+
+## Decision
+- `reserve` holds, per line, `min(requested, available)` units. Lines with nothing
+  available are left out of `items`. Only when every line would get zero does it
+  raise `InsufficientStock`, and then it creates nothing.
+- Request validation (unknown warehouse or SKU, bad quantity, empty items) is still
+  all-or-nothing: a rejected request holds nothing.
+- `place_order` stays all-or-nothing and competes with holds for available stock.
+
+## Consequences
+- Callers must read `Reservation.items` to learn what was actually held. It may
+  differ from the request.
+- Idempotent retries compare the *requested* items, so the request is stored
+  alongside the idempotency key (see [0003](0003-reservation-idempotency.md)).
diff --git a/docs/adr/0003-reservation-idempotency.md b/docs/adr/0003-reservation-idempotency.md
